+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No current decision is recorded for the transport compression codec. The project's recorded decisions cover related but distinct areas — wire format (CBOR, superseding msgpack), TLS backend (OpenSSL), and an HTTPS-everywhere transport policy — but none of them specify a compression codec, so no value should be assumed until one is formally decided and recorded.
